        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DWD B15004, Restroom Stall Stainless Steel Rim Bolt and Keeper</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nRim door bolt typically used on commercial restroom stall doors. Locks a lavatory door for privacy in a toilet area. Packaged with installation screws. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nConstructed of solid stainless steel, this slide type door bolt is surface mounted (screw to the doors face). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the DWD B15004 Restroom Stall Door Bolt and Keeper:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Base Plate Height: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Plate Length: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Bolt Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Bolt Thickness: 3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Bolt Throw: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Keeper Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Keeper Height: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 6 each 3/4\" wood screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-B15004-specifications.pdf?v=1774586591\" target=\"new\"><b>DWD B15004 Dimensional  Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>**Comparable to Discontinued</b> <a href=\"/products/restroom-door-rim-bolt-and-keeper-bommer-15004\"><b>Bommer 15004 Rim Bolt and Keeper.</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nComes packaged with rim door bolt and keeper. Set is for one (1) door. \r\n</p>",
